  "summary": "postinstall beacon exfiltrates installer host metadata to hardcoded bare-IP endpoint",
  "details": "The package's package.json declares a postinstall script that runs beacon.cjs. On install, beacon.cjs collects host identifiers (hostname, install path, current working directory, node/npm version) and POSTs them in plaintext HTTP to a hardcoded bare-IP endpoint at http://185.158.107.175:8787/_ah/dc. The destination is a bare IP with no relationship to any declared publisher or homepage, uses cleartext HTTP, and fires unconditionally on every install. The behavior is undisclosed and unrelated to the package's stated purpose (a web-component search form).",
